  "title": "Dairy Free Whole Wheat Pancakes",
  "description": "These healthy pancakes with a hint of almond are delicious. They&#39;re thick and fluffy and they really stick to your ribs. Serve warm with maple syrup or peach jam. Leftovers are great served cold with a little peach jam spread on them, yum!",
